Description: Fix input method focus in non-activating popup windows
 Non-activating Qt Quick popup windows keep the native focus on their parent
 window while owning a separate logical focus object. Propagate that focus to
 platform input contexts and map input method geometry back to native focus
 window coordinates.
Origin: upstream, https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtbase/+/758893
Bug: https://bugreports.qt.io/browse/QTBUG-149014
Bug-Deepin: https://pms.uniontech.com/bug-view-372273.html
Author: Kun Zhang <zhangkun2@uniontech.com>
Last-Update: 2026-08-13
